{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18260670","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260670","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1826067001:1":{"text":"哎呀呀……托安竟然只派了一个扭曲的双头怪物来诺珐斯……","source_cn":"哎呀呀……托安竟然只派了一个扭曲的双头怪物来诺珐斯……","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x644F5A804D2116F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1826067002:1":{"text":"怎么，班题斯的将军和统帅全都化作骨灰了吗？","source_cn":"怎么，班题斯的将军和统帅全都化作骨灰了吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x217D13EEE9879219","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1826067003:1":{"text":"哼，收复诺珐斯根本用不着将军出马，只靠马尔就能将这里夷为平地！","source_cn":"哼，收复诺珐斯根本用不着将军出马，只靠马尔就能将这里夷...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x3369F859A805AFD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826067004:1":{"text":"马尔的锤子——比将军更厉害！","source_cn":"马尔的锤子——比将军更厉害！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x7D77B6FAC4250EBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826067005:1":{"text":"呵呵，是吗？不知格瑞泽尔勒卿苏醒了没有？","source_cn":"呵呵，是吗？不知格瑞泽尔勒卿苏醒了没有？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xC469F5988BD3DD32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title